# The three-sphere materials scene from "Ray Tracing in One Weekend"
# (chapter 11): a glass sphere with an air bubble, a matte blue sphere and
# fuzzy gold metal on a yellow-green ground.

image_width  800
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 100
max_depth    50

material ground lambertian 0.8 0.8 0.0
material center lambertian 0.1 0.2 0.5
material glass  dielectric 1.5
material bubble dielectric 0.6666667   # air inside glass: 1.0 / 1.5
material gold   metal 0.8 0.6 0.2 1.0

sphere  0    -100.5 -1    100   ground
sphere  0     0     -1.2  0.5   center
sphere -1     0     -1    0.5   glass
sphere -1     0     -1    0.4   bubble
sphere  1     0     -1    0.5   gold
